{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_08",
  "title": "旷古之晤",
  "storyCode": "WB-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "358a7a2399aaa9147d39012b5333ca383ba1c025c48668d0cf452be9a592652d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被挤到的百姓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的行李掉了，别挤别挤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "时间还够，请大家有秩序地撤离，不要惊慌，避免踩踏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妈妈妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呜呜，我怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努力镇定的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别怕，抓紧妈妈的手，别走丢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊慌的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们去哪儿啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努力镇定的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咱们住的地方，每年都要刮上几次大风，这次也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努力镇定的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不想被吹跑呀，就乖乖躲一躲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伴随着隆隆声响，庞大而方正的阴影自玉门城墙外升起，渐渐遮住了半边日头——\n“玉门四卫”。四组被称作“屏风卫”的外挂移动防护墙体，由土木天师专门设计，军中冶造司承造。\n数百年来，玉门作为炎国的屏障，戍守塞上；屏风卫作为玉门的屏障，抵御着来自大漠深处的沙尘、冬风与各类源石尘暴。\n四卫不倾，三风不度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "乖乖，好高......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "来到玉门三年，我还没看过屏风卫升起来呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "少见多怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "玉门基础墙体本来就高，加上城头架设了全套的源石防御工事，一般规模的天灾，需要启动屏风卫的次数很少，但也不是没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "但这次为了避灾迁移半城的百姓，我入伍以来倒还没经历过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "那，这天灾，得是什么级别，屏风卫都挡不住吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "屏风卫已经固定完毕，精钢板块彼此间榫合得严丝合缝，连风也透不进来。\n排成长队的百姓在它投下的阴影里，向城墙的相反方向行进。或许是厚重坚实的屏风卫让大家安了心，短暂的混乱后，人群恢复了秩序。\n长行塞外，胡杨早已习惯了风沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "怎么，你小子怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "别瞎想，坚守岗位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "把眼睛放亮些，那帮山海众还混在城里。现在正是人流密集，最容易出事的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "保护好百姓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "老板，您怎么还不走啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "广播都放了好几遍，玉门快要撞上天灾了，城东的住户要在今天中午前搬到城西的避难点去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "听到啦，不急，不急。那天灾云还没到眼前呢，我得收拾收拾东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "嘿，找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "这一屋子桌椅板凳倒也罢了，这本菜谱可是命根子，不敢丢喽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "哎，这次要是运气不好，这间客栈没保下来，不如您和我一起去龙门吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "说什么呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "哎怪我多嘴，说些不吉利的话，呸呸呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "只是来的这几天，蒙您照顾，我想着凭您的手艺，在龙门开家饭馆生意肯定也红火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "那可不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "我要是走了，这里的人就再吃不到我这一手独门秘制酱兽肉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "老板是玉门本地人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "那倒不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "老家在中原，本来是去龙门谋生计。有一次想往更北边的地方看看，就趁着城市对接的机会来了玉门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "当时弄丢了钱包，就留在这家客栈打工，一转眼，自己当掌柜都这么多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "房子算不上可惜......只要人还在，家就在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "是这个理儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "唉，我陪您快点收拾吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无风。\n即使隔得很远，深色的诡异气团依然遮蔽了小半个天空。\n天灾云看起来没有移动，空气却越来越燥热。\n仿佛只等一阵风起，就会在眨眼间吹落城头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "左将军也有心情来旁观我大哥的比武？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "抗灾事宜已经安排妥当。宗师想赶在天灾之前看看那人是否值得托付，我又怎能不来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "只是用这种办法决定剑的归处，左某始终觉得荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "你与我大哥几十年的袍泽情谊，哪怕是作为朋友，也不愿意相信他的选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "......朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "我们同赴沙场，却谈不上生死与共。刀枪炮火伤不到你们，你们又怎能真正体会人的袍泽情谊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "你们终究置身事外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "“置身事外”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "我贪个“逍遥”，你这样说我倒也罢了，可对于大哥他，未免有些不公。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "人兽有别，亘古不变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "令小姐应该清楚朝廷对你们的态度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "若能有人与你们相颉颃，则可以将你们视作助力。若无人能相制衡，那宁可不用你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "我不如他，所以我不能毫无保留地相信他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "没想到，左将军也会这样坦诚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "可你未免太看轻自己了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左宣辽无言望向城外大漠，城下人影依稀，像是苍茫画卷上飞溅出了两点残墨。\n天地肃杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "那段日子，仿佛还在昨天一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "在征战之余，我们也曾四处游猎，饮酒高歌。玉门依然是玉门，为什么偏偏是平祟侯，为那么多事愁白了头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "看着这两人，你可曾想起那段峥嵘岁月？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "你说人兽有别，可你看看，偏偏此刻就有人在挑战这道沟壑屏障。这样的较量，难道不令人心潮澎湃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "别皱着眉头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "text": "喝口酒？不如我们押个输赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "好好好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你终于肯应战了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "让你等了这么久，见谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "三年而已，算不上多久。你要是还有事情没做完，我可以再等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三年前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "停停停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "这才第一合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "已经够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "刚才一合之内我们对了三拳，以你我的功力，真打实了，这会儿大概已经有人见了伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "但你收着劲，我也不能出全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "没意思，不痛快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "比武试招，点到即止......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "谁跟你比武试招，哪儿来的点到即止，要打就要全力以赴地打！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "天下武功，都是搏杀之术，哪一样不是在真正的生死历练中演化成型。你这话，不像是玉门擂台榜上第一名会说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "在理。不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "算了，知道你还有职责在身，真打起来难免束手束脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你什么时候卸任？我们把这一场续上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "那不知道要等到何年何月了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你说一个时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "......短则三五年，长则十几年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "好，那我等着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "反正你就在这城里，我也不怕你跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "事情永远是做不完的，欠下的这一战，放在此时此地，刚刚好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "这里面有我的一点私心，应该向你说明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "过去三军出征，有先锋将领在校场演武，激励士气的传统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "如今玉门即将迎战天灾，你我在阵前比这一场，就当为全城的将士们壮壮胆色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我无所谓，就怕你在全城人面前被我打趴下，面子上过不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "说起来，已经有很多年，没人像你这样向我挑战了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "已经有很多年，没人像你这样值得我挑战了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "放开手脚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "当尽全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "胜负在己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "生死有命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "怎么样？开打了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "你伤还没好，怎么这么急着下床活动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "开玩笑，好歹我也是练过几年功夫的，身体素质没那么差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "再说了，伤可以再养，这种级别的打架要是错过了，我上哪儿再看去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "我看也没有什么了不起的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "那个菲林大叔，就是你嘴里那个不靠谱的老爹吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "不愧是父女，你和你爹还真是挺像的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "哪里像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "开打前的气势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "好家伙，像是要把人吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "不过传闻那位宗师的武功高到了匪夷所思的地步，这几年已经很少真的出手了。更夸张的说法是，天下近半数的武功是他发明的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "听说你爹昨晚还打败了那个坏女人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "那你猜猜，谁能赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "不用问，你当然还是想让自己爹赢的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "他的输赢，是他的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "我只是想亲眼看看，我和他到底还有多少差距。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "梁大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "这种撸袖子抡胳膊的事情，梁大人竟然也会来凑热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "作为朋友，应该来看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "“天下闻名”，不知道他算不算达成了这个目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你看看多少双眼睛盯着这场比武，不论谁胜谁负，江湖都要多一桩美谈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "一个痴人，在让别人知道自己是谁之前，要先给自己一个交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "我们都要给自己一个交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "你最近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "本来是在专心找槐天裴，但又有些麻烦找了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我干回侦探老本行，打听到了一些事情，也大概猜到了，你的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "麻烦总是找上你，或许是有原因的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "当大哥的，总得操心自己的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "所以你都打听到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "那位宗师是令小姐的兄长，这件事在玉门并非人尽皆知。甚至该说是，秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "的确......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "宗师丢的那把剑，找回来固然是当务之急，但更麻烦的是之后该如何处置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "梁大人不想让它留在玉门，或许是司岁台的意思，或许是作为玉门参知的考量。但偏偏那位平祟侯不愿意放手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "所以你需要一个人，可以带走这把剑，还能让两边都信服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "而你正好有一个武艺高强的结义兄弟，他正好就在城中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "为了让槐天裴和整件事情关联得更紧些，将那个盗剑的女孩子引到他所在的医馆，也只是顺势为之了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "从尚蜀到玉门，每次你都找老朋友来帮你解决问题，是不是太偷懒了一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "我的朋友，并不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "有一个疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "这次，你是从什么时候开始，准备让槐天裴入局的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "算了，也不必告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "不管你动了多少心思，挑战最强的高手，成为最强的高手，毕竟是他的夙愿。就算他回过头知道了你在推波助澜，指不定还会谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "我们都在努力做原本想做的事，哪怕世事总是不太如人意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "可能这些年过去，他才是离初心理想最近的那个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "“一辈子只做成一件事”，说说容易啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "这位槐先生，竟然会带着伤来赴约......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "他这样的人，别说受伤，哪怕只有一口气吊着，也会来比这一场。死了就死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "我知道槐先生来玉门只为与老师一战，老师也承诺了。老师偶尔跟我说起这件事，他的期待，其实不输槐先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "习武之人，哪个不渴望对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "这也算是一种执念吧。莫名其妙得很，你不理解也正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "就像师姐跟在老师身边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "有时候真不知道该说你呆，还是机灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "师姐，那我先下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "好。这两人都是绝顶高手，他们的战斗恐怕会颠覆你录武簿大半的记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "我会尽可能记录得详细准确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "......不要离他们太近，免得受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "text": "知道了，师姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半日前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "就在今天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "你准备好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "听几个老兵说，玉门遭遇的劫难大大小小不下百次，但从没有过这么大的阵仗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "这次的结果会是怎样，连你也没有把握吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "情势比表面上要更复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从姜齐到玉门，自己经历过多少次危险，又有多少次命悬一线？\n没有暴尸荒野，也没有沦为山海众那样的恶徒。\n支撑着自己的是什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "我在这座城市待了这么久，受过大家许多照顾，也该出把力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "在此之前，我必须先给自己一个交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "你说过的，只要我想动手，你随时奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "嗯，不必多说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "既然准备好了，那出剑便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剑客后退一步，凝神，举剑。\n她很清楚，自己的一招一式，眼前的人都了如指掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人们常说，有仇报仇，生生世世。\n与其说这是一句颠扑不破的道理，不如说它是一种结果。\n曾经有多少人经过水寨时葬身江底，他们的亲人是否也应该向爹寻仇？\n自己为寻仇而来，杀了眼前这个人，又有多少人应该向自己寻仇？\n有仇报仇，血债血偿。杀业循环，生生世世。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "支撑着自己一路走下去的，应该是，仇恨吗？\n这个问题自己想了多久？跟在眼前这人身边，见他所见的这五年？\n不，比这更久。\n从姜齐到玉门，手里的剑早就已经染过血。我该如何为那些亡魂判定是非善恶？\n正因如此，我才会来到玉门，既为报仇，也为问剑。\n报该报的仇，解该解的惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剑势未尽，陡然回收。\n长剑脱手，落入稍远处的水渠，一排羽兽受惊飞起，鸣声嘹亮，许久才散尽。\n全然不像在练剑或迎敌时那样潇洒，收劲时的惯性差点让她受伤。\n但剑客的表情却是释然的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "这样就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "这一剑已经刺出去了。这一剑杀不了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "但我并非因为杀不了你才放下报仇的念头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "只是“仇恨”早已不再值得我出剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "看阁下的脚步，这三年来，想必武功又精进了许多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我们话说得太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重岳收回了后半句话。\n对手身上还带着伤，多聊上几句，他就能多点时间来调匀呼吸。\n可他旋即意识到了，这点体谅对眼前的人来说，只能算是羞辱。\n世间从来就没有绝对公平的战斗。\n抛开杂念，怀求胜的心，使百分的力，便是“公平”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "槐天裴握紧了拳头，每一道粗粝的掌纹都清晰可感。\n那是练拳留下的痕迹，是习武四十年的底色和豪气。\n他为这一战等待了三年，但他为了这一战做的准备，要从习武的第一天算起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "武者攀高，当凌绝顶。\n万籁无声，风停云遏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
